.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH quarters-unfreeze 1  "quarters-unfreeze " 
.SH NAME
quarters\-unfreeze \- Remove a cooperative freeze marker after exact confirmation
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquarters\-unfreeze\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-confirm\fR> [\fINAME\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove a cooperative freeze marker after exact confirmation
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-confirm\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Must exactly repeat the resolved space name
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fINAME\fR]
Space name. Defaults to the current Quarter when inside one
